---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Affiliate disclosure';
const description = 'How Screening Atlas may earn money from links to tenant screening and landlord software providers, and which links are affiliate links.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} updated="2026-11-23">
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p><strong>Current status (November 23, 2026):</strong> we have affiliate relationships with TransUnion SmartMove and Innago. Links to those providers may earn us a commission, at no extra cost to you. Every other provider link still goes to that provider's public website, and we earn nothing from it.</p>
  <p>Active affiliate programs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>TransUnion SmartMove, since November 20, 2026</li>
    <li>Innago, since November 22, 2026</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may apply to affiliate programs run by other providers we write about, such as TurboTenant, RentRedi, Rentec Direct and RentPrep. If a program approves us, links to that provider may become affiliate links, and the provider may pay us a commission at no extra cost to you. We'll list each one here with the date.</p>
  <p>Active affiliate links are marked <span class="aff-tag">affiliate link</span> and carry <code>rel="sponsored"</code>. Other provider links are ordinary links; they are not marked, and we earn nothing from them until a program is listed above.</p>
  <h2>Our rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions never change a fact, a price, or the order of a table.</li>
    <li>If a commission-paying provider is the worse choice for a situation, we say so.</li>
    <li>We include providers that don't pay us whenever leaving them out would make a comparison worse.</li>
  </ul>
</Base>
